<section class="hero wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Signal Video Drops</div><h1>TURN THE FILES<br>INTO TRANSMISSIONS.</h1><p class="lead">Short dark broadcasts from the archive: sourced Intel Desk clips, book trailers, Rumble dispatches, Facebook shorts, and source-led explainers that turn public records into pattern recognition.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn" href="transmissions.html">Open Rumble Channels</a><a class="btn alt" href="news.html">Intel Desk</a><a class="btn alt" href="books.html">Book Archive</a></div></section>
<section class="section wrap grid"><article class="card"><span class="label">Video Format</span><h2>60-Second Intel Drop</h2><p>Hook, sourced claim, evidence label, public-record context, Matrix Reprogrammed interpretation, and archive call-to-action.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">Video Format</span><h2>3-Minute Dark Explainer</h2><p>A cinematic dossier breakdown for wars, intelligence releases, court files, sanctions, leak archives, and organized-crime/state overlap.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">Video Format</span><h2>Book Trailer</h2><p>D.O.G The Architect, Intelligence Dossiers, Crime Dossiers, Black File, Masonic/esoteric books, survival titles, and dark psychology hooks.</p></article></section>
<section class="section wrap"><h2>Video Production Map</h2><p class="lead">Each channel is a route back into the Matrix Reprogrammed archive. Every video should lead to the Intel Desk, a shelf, a book page, or the Black File.</p><div class="grid"><article class="card"><h3>Vaxxed</h3><p>Medical-power records, public policy, institutional trust, and source-led debate.</p><a class="btn" href="https://rumble.com/c/VVaccines" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Channel</a></article><article class="card"><h3>Cabal</h3><p>Elite networks, power structures, hidden systems, public-record analysis, and the Black File pathway.</p><a class="btn" href="https://rumble.com/c/Vcabal" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Channel</a></article><article class="card"><h3>Plandemics</h3><p>Pandemic-era records, policy, institutions, media, and public health power.</p><a class="btn" href="https://rumble.com/c/VPlandemics" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Channel</a></article><article class="card"><h3>5G</h3><p>Technology, surveillance, infrastructure, telecom power, and system-level signal analysis.</p><a class="btn" href="https://rumble.com/c/V5G" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Channel</a></article><article class="card"><h3>2030</h3><p>Policy roadmaps, future systems, digital control, institutional planning, and public documents.</p><a class="btn" href="https://rumble.com/c/V2030" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Channel</a></article></div></section>
<section class="section wrap split"><div class="terminal">VIDEO DROP LAW
> Source before script
> Evidence label before interpretation
> Hook without fake certainty
> One clear archive path
> One book or shelf CTA
> No unsupported accusations</div><div class="card"><h2>Broadcast Rule</h2><p>Every video post needs a title, one-line hook, evidence label, source footer, book-funnel CTA, and a clean distinction between documented fact, interpretation, and speculation.</p><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="black-file.html">Build Audience First</a><a class="btn alt" href="news.html">Open Intel Desk</a></div></div></section>
<section id="phase-nine-distribution-engine" class="section wrap"><h2>Content Distribution Engine</h2><p class="lead">Turn this pathway into shorts, longform video, podcast, newsletter, article, and social-thread briefs while preserving the evidence boundary.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn internal-only" href="distribution-center.html">Distribution Center</a><a class="btn alt" href="distribution-shorts.html">Shorts</a><a class="btn alt" href="distribution-longform-video.html">Longform</a></div></section><section id="live-intel-machine-route" class="section wrap"><h2>Live Intelligence Machine</h2><p class="lead">Current public-source records with separate collection and publication dates, source classes, evidence boundaries and deeper report routes.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn" href="live-intel.html">Open Live Intel</a><a class="btn alt" href="downloads/live-intel-latest.json">Latest JSON</a><a class="btn alt" href="intel-vault.html">Intel Vault</a><a class="btn alt" href="amazon-store-books.html">Books / Store</a></div></section><section id="figure-source-status" class="section wrap source-status-panel"><h2>Figures & Sources</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card redline"><span class="label">Figures on this page</span><h3>Checked: 1 July 2026</h3><p>Numbers on this page are public-record leads. Crime, migration, sexual-offence, payout, death, and crisis figures must be tied to named official, court, police, parliamentary, regulator, or reputable source records before they are presented as settled.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">Evidence standard</span><h3>What counts as a usable figure?</h3><p>Official statistics, court records, ministry releases, police datasets, parliamentary material, regulator data, or clearly named public reports. Nationality, foreign-born status, asylum status, immigration status, charge, suspect, conviction, and victim categories must not be mixed.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">Document trail</span><h3>Open the underlying record</h3><p>When the figure matters, follow the document link, source file, court record, official release, PDF, book, or video. The visible page should help readers reach the underlying evidence fast.</p></article></div></section>

